  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rare - Scaling of the Small-Scale Fisheries Impact Bond across Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Project supports the scaling of Rare&#x2019;s Small-Scale Fisheries (SSF) Impact Bond, currently implemented in Southeast Sulawesi, Indonesia, to three additional provinces: North Sulawesi, Maluku, and North Maluku. These provinces are well suited for expansion based on initial site-selection analyses assessing habitat conditions, fish stocks, fisher density, and government receptivity. Rare&#x2019;s existing presence and partnerships in these areas reduce implementation risk and facilitate sub-national 
government support and community buy-in.</narrative>
  </description>
